<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 605 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 605 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 605 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rate unchanged and bids accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	 INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	 550	   550	    8.50  percent</p>
<p>    52 weeks	  15	    15	    9.00   percent</p>
<p>    15 years	  40	    40	   10.50 percent</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total:	    605	  605</p>
<p>($1= 8.6 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
